-end=\"1082\">Accessoires:</strong> Inclusief originele HP-lader</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"620\"> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1267\"><strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1129\">Kenmerken:</strong><br data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\">• Licht, stevig en professioneel ontwerp<br data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1175\">• Stil en energiezuinig<br data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1201\">• Ideaal voor multitasking en kantoorwerk<br data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1245\" data-is-only-node=\"\">• Direct gebruiksklaar</p>",
